#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:208
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid "The industrial revolution in reverse engineering."
msgstr "Revolucioni industrial në inxhinierinë e kundërt."

#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:209
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid "By N0zoM1z0 · 10 October 2026"
msgstr "Nga N0zoM1z0 · 10 tetor 2026"

#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:211
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid "Takeaway"
msgstr "Përfundimi kryesor"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:213
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Give agents autonomy over the investigation.{ph1} Set a clear goal and "
"acceptance criteria, then let the agent decide what to try next."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Jepuni agjentëve autonomi mbi hetimin.{ph1} Vendosni një objektiv të "
"qartë dhe kritere pranimi, më pas lëreni agjentin të vendosë se çfarë të "
"provojë më pas."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:218
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Use the repository and Git as working memory.{ph1} Keep the reasoning "
"with the code. Git checkpoints let the next session continue after the "
"conversation ends."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Përdor depon dhe Git si memorie pune.{ph1} Mbaje arsyetimin me kodin. "
"Pikat e kontrollit Git lejojnë që sesioni tjetër të vazhdojë pasi të "
"përfundojë biseda."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:223
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Let evidence decide what you claim.{ph1} A confident explanation still "
"needs testing. “Unknown” is a valid answer when the evidence is incomplete."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Lëri provat të vendosin se çfarë pretendoni.{ph1} Një shpjegim i sigurt"
" ende kërkon testim. \"E panjohur\" është një përgjigje e vlefshme kur "
"provat janë të paplota."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:228
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Test the oracle too.{ph1} Try cases it should reject. If it misses a "
"bug, revisit the earlier results that depended on it."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Testoni edhe kontrolluesin e referencës.{ph1} Provoni rastet që duhet "
"të refuzohen. Nëse i mungon një gabim, rishikoni rezultatet e mëparshme që "
"vareshin prej tij."

