msgstr "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Agjenti juaj kodues"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:243
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:265
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:293
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:415
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:456
