msgstr ""
"{ph0}Trajtuesi · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}Shkruan {ph4}{ph5}{ph6}Thërret formatuesin "
"në {ph7} dhe shkruan skedarin.{ph8}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:375
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA’s static analysis pairs the message with its handler. The destination is"
" read from code."
msgstr ""
"Analiza statike e REA e lidh mesazhin me trajtuesin e tij. Destinacioni "
"lexohet nga kodi."

