#: website/public/index.html:459
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "01 · Which branch?"
msgstr "01 · Cila degë?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/index.html:460
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“{ph0}0x5b? 0x5c?{ph1} Two jumps to the same place. Which operators are "
"these?”"
msgstr ""
"\"{ph0}0x5b? 0x5c?{ph1} Dy kërcime në të njëjtin vend. Cilët operatorë janë "
"këta?\""

#: website/public/index.html:464
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Look up the command IDs, then label the branch."
msgstr "Kërkoni ID-të e komandës, më pas etiketoni degën."

#: website/public/index.html:470
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Divide ÷"
msgstr "Ndani ÷"

#: website/public/index.html:474
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Multiply ×"
msgstr "Shumëzo ×"

#: website/public/index.html:479
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "02 · What do the calls do?"
msgstr "02 · Çfarë bëjnë thirrjet?"

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: </strong >
#: website/public/index.html:480
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“100 is clear. The calls are just addresses. {ph0}Which one divides? Which "
"value goes in?{ph1}”"
msgstr ""
"\"100 është e qartë. Thirrjet janë vetëm adresa. {ph0}Cila ndan? Cila vlerë "
"hyn?{ph1}\""

#: website/public/index.html:486
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Inspect the helpers and trace the stored values."
msgstr "Inspektoni ndihmësit dhe gjurmoni vlerat e ruajtura."

#: website/public/index.html:496
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Divide"
msgstr "Ndani"

#: website/public/index.html:501
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "03 · What is the rule?"
msgstr "03 · Cili është rregulli?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/index.html:502
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“This path multiplies by the other input. So {ph0}10% means 10% of 200{ph1} "
"after +.”"
msgstr ""
"\"Kjo rrugë shumëzohet me hyrjen tjetër. Pra, {ph0}10% do të thotë 10% e "
"200{ph1} pas +.\""

#: website/public/index.html:506
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Name the operands and check both operator paths."
msgstr "Emërtoni operandët dhe kontrolloni të dy shtigjet e operatorit."

#: website/public/index.html:522 website/public/index.html:449
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Illustrative expert reasoning"
msgstr "Arsyetimi ilustrues i ekspertit"

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: </strong >
#: website/public/index.html:525
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}You decode the instructions, follow the calls and reconstruct the "
"calculation.{ph1}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Ju deshifroni udhëzimet, ndiqni thirrjet dhe rindërtoni "
