#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>[EBP+8]</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>FILD</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>x</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:537
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}01 · Read the input.{ph1} The instruction view in REA's function result"
" reads {ph2} and uses {ph3} to load the integer. Following its caller "
"through REA establishes the screen-coordinate meaning of the C parameter "
"{ph4}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}01 · Lexoni hyrjen.{ph1} Pamja e udhëzimeve në rezultatin e funksionit "
"të REA lexon {ph2} dhe përdor {ph3} për të ngarkuar numrin e plotë. Ndjekja "
"e thirrësit të tij përmes REA vendos kuptimin e koordinatave të ekranit të "
"parametrit C {ph4}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FMUL</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x420068</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>read_bytes</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>1.5625</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:544
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}02 · Multiply by 1.5625.{ph1} {ph2} reads the double at {ph3}. The "
"bytes returned by REA's {ph4} decode to {ph5}; the C uses the same constant."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}02 · Shumëzoni me 1.5625.{ph1} {ph2} lexon vlerën double në {ph3}. "
"Bajtet e kthyera nga {ph4} e REA dekodohen në {ph5}; kodi C përdor të "
"njëjtën konstante."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FSUB</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x420070</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>500.0</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>320</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:550
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Subtract 500.0.{ph1} {ph2} reads the double at {ph3}. REA's byte "
"result decodes to {ph4}, shifting the calculation's center to screen "
"coordinate {ph5}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}03 · Zbrisni 500.0.{ph1} {ph2} lexon vlerën double në {ph3}. Rezultati "
"i bajteve nga REA dekodohet në {ph4}, duke zhvendosur qendrën e llogaritjes "
"në koordinatën e ekranit {ph5}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FMUL</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x4210a0</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>dxball_pan_scale</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>1.0</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:556
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}04 · Apply the stored scale.{ph1} The second {ph2} reads {ph3}. That "
"global is named {ph4} in the maintained source. REA's second byte read "
