#: website/public/get-started/index.html:1798
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"To refresh your agent connection, run the latest setup command again, review"
" its plan and restart your client."
msgstr ""
"Për të rifreskuar lidhjen e agjentit, ekzekutoni sërish komandën e fundit të"
" konfigurimit, rishikoni planin e tij dhe rinisni klientin tuaj."

#. {ph0}: <code>rea update</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>npx rea-agents@latest uninstall</code>
